    "notes": [
      "The upstream native panel disclosure controller and visual shader/preset modules are copied byte-for-byte at the pinned commit.",
      "The Vue view sources and selected CSS are retained unchanged as comparison sources for RELIC's adapted DOM view and styles. Vue/Pinia application stores are not imported.",
      "RELIC's planet navigation, data organization, renderer adapters and starfield are separate integration code.",
      "No upstream third-party datasets, 3D models, credentials, provider configuration, or node_modules are included.",
      "Visual shader stylization is illustrative; FLIR and night-vision modes do not provide measured thermal or low-light sensor data.",
      "The RELIC shader adapter omits the decorative NVG and FLIR HUD blocks when compiling the original sources, including simulated temperatures, counters and recording markers."
    ],
    "runtimeAssets": [
      "icons/location.svg",
      "icons/visual-presets.svg",
      "icons/pin.svg"
    ]
  }
